---
import SecondaryLayout from '../../layouts/SecondaryLayout.astro';
---
<SecondaryLayout
  title="Features"
  description="Explore the features that make Lythaus a human-first publishing platform."
  canonicalPath="/features"
>
  <section class="section section--wide">
    <h1>Features</h1>
    <p>
      Lythaus is designed to make publishing calm, thoughtful, and safe.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Invite-only community</h2>
        <p>
          Growth is intentional. Every member is invited by someone already in
          the community, keeping the signal-to-noise ratio high.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Human-reviewed moderation</h2>
        <p>
          Members can declare how content was created and flag material for
          trained moderation review. Automated detection is not advertised
          during alpha.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Transparent ranking</h2>
        <p>
          No hidden algorithms. Posts are ranked by quality signals and
          community engagement, not by who pays the most.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Cross-platform</h2>
        <p>
          Available on Android, iOS, and the web. Your account and content
          sync seamlessly across all devices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Privacy by default</h2>
        <p>
          Minimal data collection, session-scoped tokens, and no third-party
          trackers. Your data stays yours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h2>Appeals process</h2>
        <p>
          Eligible appeals are reviewed by five independently assigned trained
          reviewers, then confirmed by a trained adjudicator. High-risk cases
          require two independent adjudications; community voting is not used.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SecondaryLayout>
